# venus-impl: a6l-modules.sh misc loads rom/modules/video.txt (persist.vendor.a6l.venus=1), waits for the
# "qcom-venus-encoder" node, gives it to the codec service (owner media) and publishes vendor.a6l.venus=ready|failed.
# The V4L2 Codec2 store only advertises an encoder whose device exists (A6L patch 0002), so the service (started
# earlier with class hal) is restarted once to pick the encoder up. Apps whose MediaCodecList was built before keep
# the software encoder until they restart.
on property:vendor.a6l.venus=ready
    restart android-hardware-media-c2-v4l2-hal
